# MaCSad public research digest

Import PublicApp from "./public_app.lg".
Import PublicClosing from "./public_closing.lg".
Import PublicHero from "./public_hero.lg".
Import PublicMasthead from "./public_masthead.lg".
Import PublicationPolicy from "./publication_policy.lg".
Import ResearchLedger from "./research_ledger.lg".

The production entry mounts the imported evidence-first public component. It
contains no private control-plane state and performs no live administrative read.
The complete reachable closure is also imported here as a pinned-compiler
scope-attribution compatibility lock; logical dependencies remain module-local.

## Main
Render:
    css "html, body, #root { width: 100%; min-height: 100%; } body { max-width: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }"
Mount MacsAdPublic at "#root".
